(d/'README.md').write_text('''This is author local macOS Lean 4.33.1 kernel evidence for the exact actual rangefinder expectation and its finite Gaussian product machinery. It is not independent review, Linux CI, Comparator evidence, or a complete proof of RE06.\n\nThe fixed matrix product result proves integrability and `E ||U Z V||_F² = ||U||_F² ||V||_F²` under the actual finite product Gaussian law, including rectangular and zero dimensions. Genuine HasLaw/original-stream transports and Fubini helpers for coefficients depending measurably on an independent parameter are proved. The actual Gaussian head/tail row split is a proved product law.\n\n`stream_rangefinder_tail_moment C r hr hk offset` proves actual tailRandomEnergy integrability and the exact expectation `residualTailEnergy C r * r/(k-r-1)` with only `r≤n` and `r+1<k`. The generic HasLaw version and almost-sure actual head right-inverse facts are also proved. There is no rank premise on the residual matrix and no inverse-moment oracle. The proof consumes the separately proved actual rectangular pseudoinverse inverse moment. No frozen public export gains a premise.\n\nAll 60 exact project sources were compiled from source in an initially empty project object tree, in recorded groups of 44 and 16, against pinned read-only dependencies. All source bytes match the managed worktree. The six new modules are warning-free. Inherited warnings remain visible in their original logs. The explicit audit checks 38 actual theorem declarations and five functional definitions, all with kernel trust and only the standard three axioms. Two negative controls reject a definition mislabeled as a theorem and a theorem mislabeled as a functional definition. All failed and intermediate author attempts are retained as diagnostics.\n\nTo replay with another exact official runtime and built pinned dependencies, use:\n\n```sh\npython3 replay.py --lean /absolute/path/to/lean-4.33.1/bin/lean --packages /absolute/path/to/pinned/.lake/packages\n```\n\nThe replay verifies every source hash and all ten package heads, creates a fresh object directory, retains each invocation and output, and reruns both declaration-kind negative controls. The driver does not fetch dependencies or reuse project objects.\n''')
